cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AetherCFD Studio in your work, please cite it as below, and cite OpenFOAM and the methods you used (see docs/references.md)."
type: software
title: "AetherCFD Studio: a Windows desktop workbench for OpenFOAM"
abstract: >-
  AetherCFD Studio is a Windows desktop application for OpenFOAM, which runs in WSL2. It sets up, meshes,
  checks, runs and post-processes OpenFOAM cases; every change is a planned, approved and journalled edit
  of the real case files. It includes verification tools (grid convergence index), run guards with a
  divergence watchdog, modal analysis, surrogates, PINN field reconstruction and an optional AI copilot
  whose every change needs the user's approval.
